{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-06. It distinguishes missing (key absent) from explicit null before reading the value, accepts exact integer 2..11 inclusive, and returns {kind,offset} in every outcome. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation was performed by this example reviewer.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-06", "description": "Classify raw offset: missing -> {kind:"missing",offset:null}; explicit null -> {kind:"null",offset:null}; exact integer 2..11 -> {kind:"integer",offset:original}; other -> {kind:"invalid",offset:null}. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions. Target typed inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.", "content": "def classify_offset(mapping):
